  <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;">Dear Hiring Manager,</p>

  <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;">I am writing to express my interest in opportunities at the intersection of Ai architecture, autonomous systems, and cloud infrastructure. With 14+ years of experience in digital marketing and a proven track record of building sovereign Ai infrastructure from the ground up, I bring a unique combination of strategic vision and hands-on technical execution.</p>

  <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;">As the founder of OpenRoyleAl, I architected a distributed autonomous Ai system using Cloudflare Workers, D1, Vectorize, and Durable Objects — running 24/7/365 across Linux and Android nodes with 6-second average task execution latency. I manage 63+ API keys and secrets securely in D1, enabling fully autonomous operations without vendor lock-in. This infrastructure was built using OpenClaw, which I adopted in January 2025 at 18.7K stars (now 361K+) and now use daily across Windows, Mac, Linux, Cloudflare, and Android.</p>

  <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;">Currently, I lead the strategic pivot of Iceberg Media — a 14-year SEO agency — into Ai services, transitioning from £300/month retainers to £20K–£35K enterprise Ai agent implementation projects. I manage 168 Google Business Profiles and ~110 domains on Cloudflare-first architecture, and have built and led teams of 10+ across development, support, and sales.</p>

  <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;">I founded and organize the OpenClaw Cebu 🦞 community, building the local Ai agent development ecosystem and speaking internationally on Ai business transformation. My approach combines deep technical knowledge with real business results — I build systems that work autonomously, reliably, and at scale.</p>

  <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;">I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience in autonomous Ai infrastructure and business transformation could contribute to your organization's goals.</p>

  <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;">Best regards,</p>
  <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;"><strong>Hans Al Koch (HAK)</strong></p>

